#!RuleTest
#test PMDA-SD1043 expect=skipped domain=LB
#note "FRESH (the twin has no skip). LB WITHOUT the LBTESTCD column. Requirements.Variables.All [--TESTCD] names the absent variable -> SKIPPED. Even executed, an absent TARGET yields zero findings via the EC-53 fast path - the pin is the auditable reporting state (skipped vs silent), the SD0040 hoist rationale transposed."
#library standard=sdtmig version=3-4
dataset LB class=FINDINGS label="Laboratory Test Results"
col STUDYID type=Char label="Study Identifier"
col DOMAIN  type=Char label="Domain Abbreviation"
col USUBJID type=Char label="Unique Subject Identifier"
col LBSEQ   type=Num  label="Sequence Number"
col LBTEST  type=Char label="Lab Test or Examination Name"
---
S1 | LB | 001 | 1 | Glucose
S1 | LB | 002 | 1 | Glucose
